# Azure Service Bus Configuration
# Azure Service Bus Configuration
SERVICE_BUS_CONNECTION_STRING=Endpoint=sb://your-servicebus.servicebus.windows.net/;SharedAccessKeyName=your-key-name;SharedAccessKey=your-key

# Topic and Subscription Names
COMMAND_TOPIC_NAME=commandtopic
COMMAND_SUBSCRIPTION_NAME=gradersubscription
REWARD_TOPIC_NAME=rewardtopic

# Optional: Custom grader prompt
GRADER_PROMPT="You are a agent trajectory grader. Given the user query/task and the answer from the agent, judge the agent's trajectory understanding what it is doing right, what it is doing wrong etc. Make sure to provide your solution in a rating between 1--5, 1 being a bad trajectory (not using any tool calls, or making a mistake in a tool call) and 5 being a perfect trajectory - everything was correct with the tool call, queries asked in the tool call etc. Also, the 3 tools in the trajectory will be <web> for web based tasks, <code> to code out a specific part and <azure> to setup the infrastructure. Provide only the rating from 1-5 and nothing else. "
